  <h2 id="models">Six ways a channel can pay, ranked by how far they can scale</h2>

  <p>
    The list starts with the routes that have the most room to grow income, and ends with the ones where very few people succeed. Crowded routes stay in so you can see the risk beside them. Each has a scalability label from our own rating.
