  <h2 id="cost">Team, cost and the boring 80%</h2>

  <p>
    The cost of YouTube is mostly time. You can start with the phone in your hand. The real bill is the hours behind each video, and those hours repeat every week.
  </p>

  <div class="feature-grid">
    {costCards.map((item) => (
